1
00:00:00,527 --> 00:00:03,637
(Sheldon:)was an obvious reference
to Fantastic Four member The Thing,

2
00:00:03,797 --> 00:00:07,537
(Sheldon:)-who's made entirely of--
-Shut up. I solved it!

3
00:00:11,838 --> 00:00:14,008
(Sheldon:)Those are map coordinates.

4
00:00:14,174 --> 00:00:16,214
(Sheldon:)Got 'em. Let's go.

5
00:00:16,376 --> 00:00:19,286
(Penny:)Wait. Don't you want to know
how I figured it out?

6
00:00:19,446 --> 00:00:21,046
(Sheldon:)No one likes a know-it-all, Penny.

7
00:00:25,819 --> 00:00:28,699
J' (SINGING NEIL DIAMOND'S
"AMERICA") J'

8
00:00:44,638 --> 00:00:45,978
(Raj:)Um...

9
00:00:46,073 --> 00:00:51,083
(Leonard:)I'm okay with you driving my car,
I'm not okay with you flying my car.

10
00:00:51,244 --> 00:00:53,314
(Bernadette:)Don't sweat it, my dad's a cop.
He can fix things.

11
00:00:54,982 --> 00:00:57,262
(Leonard:)Uh-huh. Like death?

12
00:00:57,417 --> 00:01:04,027
(Bernadette(out of the window):)Your kid may be an honour student,
but you're a moron!

